<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-16T04:46:42.138Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 04:46:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian forces have seized a key town in Tigray together with its regional airport and are moving toward an Eritrean border town, while fighting in Amhara has left at least 183 dead, according to the UN. Militia reports claim Eritrean forces suffered losses as Ethiopian troops expand control in Tigray. The United States is urging Ethiopia and Eritrea to de-escalate, and leaders of Egypt, Eritrea, Sudan and Somalia are meeting to coordinate security operations if the fighting spreads across borders. The war caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQb3J5Sk1xdnNwNXYtQnlMOVhHU1l6SDdRUjZXenFGQWxLWVN3LWV5eXdfVWdWY0xfT1B3aU9GTEw4YUlVNndBZldKR3hQNkZ1M1BaTGR2YUp2RUE2NFZZWWdQQ08td2dfbmhqYkc3YkZtdk1aTTRaazBkRGs3WjBVMWhkc2ozX2hIel9qUG16QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOUzg5bHdMQnB0TTJENDN5Sk0tUlpTTG5Lb1AzY2ZCaEpmaV9fTVQzMWtRMXdWX2RnczBRZ1h0UXY0UW14eTdQSlh0RURMQWRNYkUtZGRfaVZMaVZQSnp0MXZla2JPbFM2cENMV3RjUnRxOXhKc1Bsc1JPcmNhcWlCTVA5MGtZNk9FQmxWSlU5UG9HQkNiNDFsaEdSTzVBaXlGZFlEUFhhRkszWlNkRi1BaDB0T2JHckIy0gG-AUFVX3lxTFBQclR3dlVGRktnOWlnOXB3aG9oSE4tY0w0bjBJeG9IX3daX3ZzQkJQd0VaMDhKY1BnRFBEQ0daUnRURzdoSjk5QThEOWNfenlzWGI2MkNoUzM4eFpIWDVQWGZJRW50OTZiRWRIWVAyY0xwSWxKejkwTll3RmNicURLTUhDc2ttLVFmNW44MEZxdXctTDEzS1hackNMdkQzMFBEUlU5aWZIUkR2Y3o0dWJJMTFheVg4MFROd3FXNFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sunday Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQb2FQTWlGMzdwSWxvMmdvRDNvc290Qkk2bnpjbkxIaU5UZUVrXzZPbWgzR3JuQ2dPOXkyYlk1VjhMNl8teWJ3aE41UFFLS0pnYlB1ZGEwS0lPYzJYcWRkVjZwdkw3NEgtUXFwZm5jdDd3cXVxdlZCMnEwTDNway1tZmZtMXhjWFl0RmtOTlFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;